<main class="service-detail-page"><div class="container"><div class="row service-detail-layout"><aside class="col-lg-4"><div class="service-sidebar"><div class="service-nav-card"><h3>Freight Services</h3><ul><li><a href="ocean-freight.html">Ocean Freight <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></li><li><a href="air-freight.html">Air Freight <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></li><li><a href="cargo-freight.html">Cargo Freight <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></li><li><a href="express-delivery.html">Express Delivery <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></li><li><a class="active" href="customs-clearance.html">Customs Clearance <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></li><li><a href="project-cargo.html">Project Cargo <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></li><li><a href="pet-transport.html">Pet Transport <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></li></ul></div><div class="service-help-card"><h3>Shipping across borders?</h3><p>Review your paperwork early to spot missing details before your cargo arrives.</p><a href="contact.html">Discuss clearance needs <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ms-2"></i></a></div></div></aside>
<div class="col-lg-8"><div class="service-main-image"><img src="/images/service-5.jpg" alt="Customs documentation reviewed for international freight clearance"></div>
<section class="service-overview"><div class="service-kicker">Clearer border processes</div><h1>Clear guidance for cross-border shipments</h1><p>International shipping requires accurate declarations, complete commercial paperwork, and attention to destination requirements. <%= business.name %> helps coordinate the information and clearance steps for your shipment.</p><p>We use the details provided by importers, exporters, and service partners. Customs authorities determine the final requirements, duties, taxes, inspections, and release decisions.</p></section>
<section class="service-features"><h2 class="service-section-title">Clearance coordination</h2><div class="row g-4"><div class="col-md-6"><div class="service-feature"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-circle-check"></i><h3>Document review</h3><p>We review commercial documents for missing or inconsistent information before submission.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-6"><div class="service-feature"><i class="fa-solid fa-list-check"></i><h3>Declaration support</h3><p>We coordinate cargo descriptions, values, origins, and classification details.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-6"><div class="service-feature"><i class="fa-solid fa-building-columns"></i><h3>Authority coordination</h3><p>We share clearance updates and requests for further information with the relevant contacts.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-6"><div class="service-feature"><i class="fa-solid fa-truck-fast"></i><h3>Release handoff</h3><p>After release, we help connect your cargo with the next transport stage.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="service-process"><h2 class="service-section-title">The clearance process</h2><div class="row g-4"><div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3"><div class="service-process-step"><div class="service-process-number">01</div><h3>Collect</h3><p>We gather shipment details and commercial paperwork.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3"><div class="service-process-step"><div class="service-process-number">02</div><h3>Review</h3><p>We review the information for missing or conflicting details.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3"><div class="service-process-step"><div class="service-process-number">03</div><h3>Submit Documents</h3><p>We coordinate the information needed for clearance.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3"><div class="service-process-step"><div class="service-process-number">04</div><h3>Release</h3><p>Transport continues once the authorities approve release.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="service-faqs"><h2 class="service-section-title">Questions about customs support</h2><div class="accordion" id="customsFaq"><div class="accordion-item"><h3><button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#customsOne">What paperwork might I need?</button></h3><div id="customsOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" data-bs-parent="#customsFaq"><div class="accordion-body">Requirements differ by shipment. Common documents include a commercial invoice, packing list, transport document, and any permits or certificates required for the goods.</div></div></div><div class="accordion-item"><h3><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#customsTwo">How are duties and taxes determined?</button></h3><div id="customsTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#customsFaq"><div class="accordion-body">The responsible customs authority applies its rules based on factors including the goods’ classification, value, origin, and import treatment.</div></div></div><div class="accordion-item"><h3><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#customsThree">Can you promise a clearance date?</button></h3><div id="customsThree" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#customsFaq"><div class="accordion-body">No. Processing depends on document accuracy, inspections, permits, payments, and decisions by the relevant authorities.</div></div></div></div></section>
<div class="service-cta"><div><h2>Get your paperwork ready early</h2><p>Send your shipment details so we can begin reviewing the documents.</p></div><a href="/quote?service=customs_clearance" class="btn-default">Talk to Our Team</a></div></div></div></div></main><%- include('../partials/site-footer') %><script src="/js/jquery-3.7.1.min.js"></script><script src="/js/bootstrap.min.js"></script><script src="/js/jquery.slicknav.js"></script><script src="/js/service-navigation.js"></script></body></html>
